    h3 What we needed versus what we found
    p $\alpha=1/(1+2\sqrt2),\qquad \lambda=\sqrt2$
    .surprise-grid
      .surprise-card.needed
        h4 Needed for asymptotics
        p Bound second-eigenvalue multiplicity
        p $\Downarrow$
        p Exceptional constructions are eventually outperformed
      .surprise-card.found.fragment
        h4 What classification revealed
        p No exceptional graph has order $>28$
        p $\Downarrow$
        p.red Exceptional constructions are absolutely bounded
    p.fragment The stronger phenomenon was surprising

